ed to discuss cooperation concerns across candidates. She may keep vote for B.\n\nLet's craft: \"I appreciate confirmation that C handles stress well; however, his difficulty communicating and egocentric nature raise crew cooperation concerns, whereas B, despite his nasty remarks, has proven reliability and technical skills. I still lean toward B, but we should explore whether B's interpersonal issue can be mitigated compared to C's communication difficulty.\"\n\nThus vote remains Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
